Example Plans:

- Life Protection Monthly.
- Life Protection Annual.
- Health Protection Monthly.
- Personal Accident Annual.
- Corporate Protection.
- Bancassurance Protection.

These are illustrative product groupings. The insurer's product and policy systems remain the source of truth for coverage terms.

### Step 3 — Configure premium pricing

| Product | Premium | Frequency |
|---|---:|---|
