   v
INITIAL COLLECTION
   |
   v
PAYMENT FAILURE
   |
   v
RECOVERY WINDOW
   |
   +------> SUCCESSFUL RECOVERY
   |                 |
   |                 v
   |          INSURER STATUS UPDATE
   |
   +------> STILL UNPAID
                     |
                     v
             GRACE PERIOD ENDS
                     |
